-### Rhombic Triacontahedron SDF
 A Signed Distance Function for a Rhombic Triacontahedron crystal shape, constructed by folding 3D space using specific magic numbers and directions multiple times [S8, unofficial]. It distinguishes itself from standard convex primitives by using iterative space folding to create complex symmetry [S8, unofficial]. Chosen for artistic or crystalline visual effects [S8, unofficial].
