 *   **Strengths:** Exact distance guarantees prevent ray overshooting in sphere tracing [S1, S7, unofficial]. Simple to implement and highly parallelizable on GPUs [S7, unofficial].
-*   **Limitations:** Only supports specific geometric shapes. Complex scenes require combining primitives via CSG operations, which can increase evaluation cost and introduce artifacts for concave geometry [S7, unofficial].
