 *   **When to use:** Real-time ray marching, procedural geometry, and scenes composed of basic shapes [S1, S7, unofficial].
 *   **When not to use:** Scenes with highly complex, non-analytic geometry where mesh-based rendering or voxel-based methods are more appropriate [S8, unofficial].
